OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy,
OL,6,Fthundery showers fading inland during
OL,7,Fthe evening, then becoming largely dry
OL,8,Fovernight with clear spells. Slightly
OL,9,Fbreezy along the coast with isolated
OL,10,Fshowers continuing. Less muggy than
OL,11,Frecent nights.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FFine for much of Friday with
OL,14,Fsunny spells and variable cloud.
OL,15,FMostly dry but some isolated showers
OL,16,Falong the coast and then more broadly
OL,17,Fto end the day. Feeling fresher.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
